#: ../../source/docs/modules/genobstacles.rst:3
#: 1f2578b3801d497fb04e833c3fb813fd
msgid "Obstacle Generator"
msgstr "障碍物生成器"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/genobstacles.rst:10
#: dfd71291315f4dae81d1a846bbcecf02
msgid ""
"Allows the user to send simulated obstacles to ArduPilot, in order to "
"test object avoidance techniques. This module was originally developed "
"for the 2018 UAV Outback Challenge."
msgstr "允许用户向 ArduPilot 发送模拟障碍物，以测试避障技术。该模块最初为 2018 年 UAV Outback Challenge 比赛开发。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/genobstacles.rst:13
#: 4a264cca8ba14cb88f5e2c9af94504ff
msgid ""
"When loaded, the user can right-click on the MAVProxy map to drop "
"obstacles. These include birds, planes and clouds. These are sent to "
"127.0.0.1:45454 in ASTERIX format."
msgstr ""
"加载后，用户可在 MAVProxy 地图上右键点击放置障碍物，包括鸟类、飞机和云朵。这些障碍物以 ASTERIX 格式发送至 "
"127.0.0.1:45454。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/genobstacles.rst:16
#: f25dba3324054541944133dd2eb9f06e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The ``asterix`` module will receive these obstacles from 127.0.0.1:45454 "
"and convert to a ``ADSB_VEHICLE`` MAVLink message and then on-send to "
"ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"``asterix`` 模块将从 127.0.0.1:45454 接收这些障碍物信息，转换为 ``ADSB_VEHICLE`` MAVLink "
"消息后发送给 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/genobstacles.rst:19
#: 91ad8f2fa1824f95adc154cfeac35de0
msgid ""
"If ADSB avoidance is enabled, ArduPilot will then attempt to avoid the "
"object."
msgstr "若启用了 ADSB 避障功能，ArduPilot 将尝试规避该障碍物。"

